de, not directly related to the signal strength in the γγ decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_effective", "why": "Modifiers for effective Higgs boson couplings, not directly related to the signal strength in the γγ decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "why": "Modifier for resolved Higgs boson coupling, not directly related to the signal strength in the γγ decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu-z-inclusive", "why": "Signal strength for Z+jets (Z->bb) in an inclusive region, not related to the Higgs boson signal strength in the γγ decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:abs_y_h", "why": "Kinematic distribution of the Higgs boson rapidity, not related to the signal strength in the γγ decay channel."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:p-value-mu-h-compatibility", "why": "This is a p-value for a related but different observable, not the specific signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_ratio", "why": "This is a ratio of coupling modifiers, which is a different observable from the signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-zh", "why": "This is a specific production mode of the Higgs boson, but it is not the inclusive signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-th", "why": "This is a specific production mode of the Higgs boson, but it is not the inclusive signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:mu_vz_bb", "why": "This is a signal strength for a different process (VZ, Z→bb), not the inclusive Higgs boson signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-tth", "why": "This is a specific production mode of the Higgs boson, but it is not the inclusive signal strength modifier asked about."}, {"id": "hepkg:observable:xsec-br-ggf-bbh", "why": "This is a specific production mode of the Higgs boson, but it is not the inclusive signal strength modifier asked about."}, {