son (WWW/WWZ/WZZ/ZZZ), which is a different set of processes from diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_cross_section_theory", "why": "Refers to diboson cross-section, which is not the same as background modelling uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:z_plus_jets_background_modelling", "why": "Specific to Z+jets background, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttZ-modelling", "why": "Specific to ttZ background, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:diboson_normalisation", "why": "Refers to diboson cross-section normalisation uncertainty, which is not the same as background modelling uncertainty."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:single_top_modelling", "why": "This is about single-top-quark background, not diboson."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:vvv-normalization", "why": "This is about triboson (VVV) background, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:reducible_background_estimation", "why": "This is about Z+X reducible background, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:data-driven-ttbar", "why": "This is about data-driven ttbar background estimation, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:zjets_normalization", "why": "This is about Z+jets background normalization, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:muon_bkg_desc_low_q2", "why": "This is about the parameterization of the background function for B+->K+mu+mu-, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-modelling-spurious-signal", "why": "This is about background m_gammagamma modelling, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-normalisations", "why": "This is about combined inclusive background normalisation, not specific to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:mc-statistics", "why": "This is about Monte Carlo statistical uncertainty in signal-region background predictions, not specific to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:background-estimation-uncertainty", "why": "This is about background estimation uncertainty, including simulated background normalisation and multijet yield/shape, but not specific to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:zjets_modelling", "why": "This is about Z+jets modelling, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wjets-modelling", "why": "This is about W+jets modelling, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ)."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbarZ-modelling", "why": "This is about ttbar+Z modelling, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttbar-modelling", "why": "This is about ttbar modelling, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:wt-ttbar-interference-modelling", "why": "This is about Wt modelling, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:semileptonic_ttbar_bkg_modelling", "why": "This is about semileptonic ttbar background modelling, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:nonprompt-lepton-bkg-modelling", "why": "This is about non-prompt-lepton background modelling, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:pileup_modeling_uncertainty", "why": "This is about pileup modelling uncertainty, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttw-me-modelling", "why": "This is about ttW matrix element modelling, which is not directly related to diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background modelling."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:ttw-ps-modelling", "why": "This is related to top quark and W boson production, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:multijet-uncertainty", "why": "This is about multi-jet background, not diboson (WW, WZ, ZZ) background."}, {"id": "hepkg:systematic:tzq-modelling", "w